id=bcm_bt_fix
name=Samsung BCM4375 Bluetooth Fix
version=3.1
versionCode=4
author=Antigravity
description=Fixes Bluetooth audio drops, Watch/Buds disconnections, and A2DP stuttering on Galaxy S20 Ultra by neutralizing HCI timeout suicide, skipping unsupported LE_ENERGY_INFO, disabling Qualcomm/Samsung DSP A2DP offload, extending timeouts to 60s, disabling sniff collisions, fixing A2DP software encoding, and stabilizing PCIe combo chip power.
